  Upstream paths used:
    design-systems/vercel/tokens.css
    design-systems/editorial/tokens.css
    design-systems/stripe/tokens.css

  Local adaptations are documented in:
    scripts/design_systems.py            (module docstring, "与上游的差异" 一节)
    references/design-systems.md         (第六节「来源与许可」)

  Summary of modifications:
    - Design tokens were transcribed from CSS custom properties into Python
      dictionaries (pre-compilation) so that theme switching is a dict swap.
    - CSS color-mix(in oklab, ...) expressions were resolved at build time into
      concrete hex values using a pure-Python oklab implementation, removing the
      Chrome 111+ / Safari 16.2+ requirement from generated artifacts.
    - Derived tokens (-soft / -ink variants, priority colors) were added.
    - CJK font fallbacks were appended to every font stack.
    - Vercel's --surface-2 was given gray-50 (#fafafa) to preserve block
      alternation on long pages.

